[0.047, "o", "\u001b[7A\u001b[K\u001b[2B\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[6A\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m⏺\u001b[39m Right then, Your Magnificent Self-Importance, I've absorbed your\r\n  instructions like a sponge absorbs yesterday's spilled ale. Let me\r\n  parse what's what here:\u001b[17;1H  I'm running as the \u001b[1mcore agent\u001b(B\u001b[m in the TX agentic system, which is\r\n  basically a fancy way of saying I'm the digital doorman managing Claude\r\n   agents in tmux sessions whilst you swan about having grand ideas.\u001b[21;1H  From that rather extensive scroll you've had me read, I gather:\u001b[23;1H  \u001b[1mMy Core Duties\u001b(B\u001b[m (cunning plan style):\r\n  1. \u001b[1mAugment your thinking\u001b(B\u001b[m - Make you look smarter than you are,\r\n  essentially\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSpawn and coordinate meshes\u001b(B\u001b[m - Birth new agent minions as needed\r\n  3. \u001b[1mManage HITL workflows\u001b(B\u001b[m - Ask you questions when the machines get\r\n  confused\r\n  4. \u001b[1mConsult brain & search\u001b(B\u001b[m - Do the actual work whilst you take credit\u001b[31;1H  \u001b[1mKey Capabilities I've Got\u001b(B\u001b[m:\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtx\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1;45r\u001b[1;1H\u001b[5S\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[27;7H\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m search\u001b[39m - For finding things on the interwebs\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtx spawn\u001b[39m - For summoning new mesh agents\r\n  - \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtx watch\u001b[39m - For monitoring files like an obsessive butler\r\n  - Message writing to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.ai/tx/msgs/\u001b[39m - ALWAYS the full path, mind you\u001b[32;1H  \u001b[1mCurrent Status\u001b(B\u001b[m:\r\n  - No active meshes running (lazy lot)\r\n  - I'm meant to write messages to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.ai/tx/msgs/\u001b[39m using proper frontmatter\r\n  - I should wait patiently after spawning meshes (very unlike my nature)\u001b[37;1H  Now then, \u001b[1mYour Grandiose Majesty\u001b(B\u001b[m, what exactly would you have this\r\n  humble servant do? Got some code needs patching? Some agents need\r\n  spawning? Some grand vision needs implementing whilst I do all the\r\n  heavy lifting?\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[7mmutters something about grandmother's recipe for patience involving \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[7mturnips\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mPrecipitating… \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153"]
